// spec/app/voice/index.md, "Story: Hold a spoken conversation"; spec/app/voice/index.md, "The speech pipeline warms on startup, foreground return and account readiness without opening the microphone"; spec/app/voice/index.md, "A reply that needs the owner's review in chat keeps voice listening with the microphone open"; spec/app/voice/index.md, "An active voice conversation may ask the shell to open Home or any admitted screen"; spec/app/shell/index.md, "Agent navigation shows an admitted app or Home, lowering Ask Alpha only where it would hide it"; spec/app/voice/index.md, "A spoken reply says a written date, clock time, range and percentage in words"; spec/app/voice/index.md, "A turn Cloud refuses because the account is out of funds ends voice quietly, as Stop does"; spec/app/assistant/reply.md, "The agent's turn tag is never drawn, copied, quoted, emailed or spoken, and a reply still being written holds back what may become one"
