  // spec/app/voice/index.md, "A reply that needs the owner's review in chat keeps voice listening with the microphone open": a reply that proposed a text to send or a step to run at once, which Talk neither showed as a card nor ran, speaks of what did not happen, so the turn ends quietly without setting reviewPending; the chat keeps the reply.
